  - swrl-rules
  - expert-system
  - rice-disease
  - pellet-reasoner
  - smart-agriculture
  - explainable-ai
abstract: >-
  An explainable semantic knowledge graph and multi-tier SWRL reasoning
  system for rice disease diagnosis. The framework formalizes 6 evidence-backed
  biotic threats (5 phytopathogenic diseases plus 1 plant-parasitic nematode),
  54 phenotypic symptoms, and 12 SWRL inference rules across two confidence tiers
  using OWL 2 Description Logic with the Pellet DL reasoner. Insect damage signs
  are recognized via an explicit out-of-scope differential response.
